load R1 R14          ; Load 16 into R2
multiply R14 R14 R15 ; 16x16 = 256 -> R15 (Make halt)
store R15 R14        ; Write halt behind yourself
add R0 R1 R6         ; Store next address into R6
multiply R2 R3 R4    ; Multiply counter (R2) by offset (R3) -> R4
increment R2 R2      ; Increment counter (R2)
add R1 R4 R4         ; Add the result (R4) to the current position (R1) and store into back into R4 
store R4 R15         ; Halt->added from R4
add R0 R6 R1         ; Jump to multiply ^